{"id":4459,"title":{"romaji":"Izure Saikyou no Renkinjutsushi?","english":"Possibly the Greatest Alchemist of All Time","native":"いずれ最強の錬金術師？"},"slug":"izure_saikyou_no_renkinjutsushi","synopsis":"Not even a hero, Takumi Iruma gets accidentally mixed in with a group of heroes chosen to be summoned to another world. As compensation for the mix-up, a goddess offers him the right to choose any skill he wishes for! Hoping for a peaceful and quiet life that has nothing to do with fighting or going into battle, he chooses a seemingly boring creation skill. However, it turns out \"alchemy\" is the most powerful skill that allows him to create everything from a holy sword to flying ships! This cheat skill he unexpectedly acquired turns him into a wealthy merchant and makes him undefeatable in battles! A heartwarming adventure story about (possibly) the most powerful alchemist in another world!\n\n(Source: AlphaPolis)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2025,"createdAt":"2025-01-03 06:26:52","updatedAt":"2025-01-03 06:26:52","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":12653},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":18620},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":177506},{"site":"ANN","externalId":32719},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":48842},{"site":"MAL","externalId":58822},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":24577}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":12306,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/fpzExO7tZk0PEphiewnLLRg1cMwqGetDayFnxzNI.avif"},{"id":12307,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/nUhQF4hbaHI9uFTyY3CgjhifSemRtPHjEWVO57M9.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":103,"name":"Studio Comet","slug":"studio_comet"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":13355,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":13291,"title":{"romaji":"TREASURE!","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":15628,"version":1,"episodes":"1-4","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"vid